     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Start tx promptly once diagnosed; tx within the first 3 days of infection can prevent muscle invasion and halt progression."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
