    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Antihelminthic + corticosteroid regimens are CI in children < 2 years and in pregnancy: pyrantel is the alternative, a single dose of 10 to 20 mg/kg; pyrantel acts only on intestinal larvae, not larvae in muscle."
     }
    ]
   }
